OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA damp and murky start to
OL,6,FWednesday but becoming drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter into the afternoon. Milder in
OL,8,Fthe far southwest but feeling chilly
OL,9,Felsewhere and winds picking up along
OL,10,Fcoasts later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny lingering cloud tends to
OL,13,Fclear, with a chillier night than
OL,14,FTuesday night allowing for the odd
OL,15,Fmist, fog and frost to form in rural
OL,16,Fspots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
