OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAfter any mist clears,
OL,6,FThursday will be dry with plenty of
OL,7,Fautumnal sunshine. Winds easing
OL,8,Fovernight but feeling cold for the
OL,9,Ftime of year. Cold overnight with a
OL,10,Ffrost.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FPlenty
OL,13,Fof sunshine on Friday, but it turns
OL,14,Fcloudier on Saturday while remaining
OL,15,Fdry and cold throughout, with
OL,16,Fwidespread overnight frosts. It turns
OL,17,Fmilder and damper on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
